 ## Errors
 
 Exit codes: `0` success, `2` usage/configuration, `3` client permission denial, `4` network/uncertain result, `5` server response error. Stop on 401/403 and inspect `capabilities`; do not retry around authorization failures.
+
+## Storage timestamp readback (2.5.1)
+
+The server accepts timezone-qualified ISO 8601 verification times and Unix milliseconds, then reads back milliseconds. The CLI compares equivalent instants for `verifiedAt`; every other requested field must still match, and missing lifecycle fields remain a verification failure. Apply the server storage lifecycle migration before relying on this contract.
